      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityneighborhoods.nyc/marine-park",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Marine Park is Brooklyn’s largest public park, spanning over 2,000 acres of salt marsh and wetlands.",
